CSC T VERSION 0.1
  PURPOSE "p"
  EVENT IN e
  SCENARIO s1 EXPECT ADMITTED
    @0 s e
    REPEAT FOREVER EVERY 1 s
    @1 s e
    REPEAT FOREVER EVERY 1 s
  SCENARIO s2 EXPECT ADMITTED
    @0 s e
    REPEAT 5..2 EVERY 1 s
    @0 s e
  SCENARIO s3 EXPECT ADMITTED
    REPEAT FOREVER EVERY 1 s
  SCENARIO s4 EXPECT ADMITTED
    @0 e
    REPEAT FOREVER EVERY 1 s
    @0 e
END
